# gm codesearch exclusions. Gitignore syntax, anchored at this file's directory.
# Declared so an unscoped codesearch on this project stays inside its 45 s wall
# budget instead of dying partway through the tree at exhaustive: false.
#
# 1. Headless Chrome profile / WebGPU cache trees: 6127 of 8771 listed files,
#    all binary cache blobs (component_crx_cache, DawnWebGPUCache,
#    GrShaderCache, Cache/Cache_Data). Never code.
runs/chrome-*/
runs/rl-profile/
#
# 2. Genome / brain exports ({"format":"npc-brain/2"|"npc-population-member/1"}).
#    Extensionless JSON weight dumps; the population ones are ~1.3 MB, over the
#    untyped-file size ceiling, so without this they are skipped for size and
#    that skip alone keeps every reply at exhaustive: false.
runs/*-base
runs/*-base-best
runs/*-base-crafter
runs/*-base-generalist
runs/*-base-hunter
